+/**
+*
+* Interface function
+*
+* return value:
+*       value = 0 :success;
+*       value = -1 :check bin header version
+*       value = -2 :check bin data type
+*       value = -3 :check sum or check bin data len error
+*       value = -4 :check data version
+*       value = -5 :check register num
+*       value = -6 :check dsp reg num
